<title>ROMANIA: ROMANIAN PRODUCER PRICES 2.1 PCT UP IN NOV.</title>
<headline>ROMANIAN PRODUCER PRICES 2.1 PCT UP IN NOV.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Producer prices in Romanian industry rose by 2.1 percent last November on the previous month and by 60.6 percent year on year, National Statistics Board data</p>
<p>showed on Friday.</p>
<p> ROMANIAN PRODUCER PRICES	 NOV 96    OCT 96   NOV 95</p>
<p> mth/mth change			+2.1     +2.1	+2.8</p>
<p>  extraction industry		+0.4     +0.1	+1.0</p>
<p>  processing industry		+2.6     +2.5	+3.2</p>
<p>  energy and gas industry	  +0.0     +0.3	+0.6</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
